var N={inspector:{cam:['Hardware','Photographs every sample under fixed lighting in a light-controlled chamber.','A food item placed in the chamber.','A raw frame to the edge device.','Consistent input beats a smarter model: the same item should photograph the same way any day.','Wired to the edge device; no network involved.','Lighting drift or a nudged camera changes scores more than any model change, so the rig is fixed and enclosed.'],ord:['External feed','Live Zomato and Swiggy delivery orders for the kitchen display.','The order feed.','The order and its reference image per plate.','The plating check needs to know what should be on the plate.','Read by the kitchen display.','Consideration: a late feed means a plate can be ready before its check appears.'],edge:['Edge software','Pre-processes the frame, detects the item, scores it 0–100 per food type and issues a verdict.','A raw frame from the camera.','Score, verdict and the photo.','Running the model on the device keeps grading working if the network drops, with no GPU on the floor.','Receives from the camera; writes to Supabase.','Runs headless on Linux with self-restarting services. Grading continues offline.'],supa:['Storage','Stores every inspection, image, order and comparison, and handles login.','Results from the edge device; orders.','Data for the dashboard and the kitchen display.','Postgres, auth and storage in one place, shared by the machine and both apps.','Written by the device, read by both apps.','The single source of truth; audit and re-training rely on the photo being kept with its verdict.'],dash:['Web app','Every inspection with photo, score and verdict; live counts and trends by food type, batch and shift.','Inspection records.','Views for management.','Makes quality visible from anywhere with nothing to install.','Reads Supabase; hosted on Vercel.','Read-only. It never alters a verdict.'],kds:['Web app','Shows live orders beside the camera capture and the reference image, and flags missing or off-standard items before the order leaves.','Orders, the capture, the reference image.','A flag to kitchen staff.','Catches problems while the plate is still in the kitchen.','Reads orders and captures from Supabase.','A flag is advisory; the final call stays with the kitchen.']},
