vehicle:{gps:['Hardware','Sends position and speed from each vehicle every few seconds.','Satellite fix.','Timestamped points.','An objective record that doesn\u2019t depend on the driver.','Streams to the geofence engine.','Consideration: gaps and jitter near a fence boundary are handled by fence sizing.'],geo:['Engine','Applies geofences around the factory, vendors and outlets, turning raw points into arrivals and departures, then computes travel time, dwell, speed and over-speed events.','Timestamped points.','Stops, trips, metrics.','Node.js handles a steady stream of small events and serves the API from one codebase.','Writes to Supabase.','A new location needs a new geofence.'],supa:['Storage','Stores telemetry, stops and daily summaries.','Points and events.','Data for the map and the summary.','Postgres handles the time-series and keeps history for disputes and planning.','Read by the map and the summary.','History is kept, not just today.'],map:['Web app','Live map during the day and route playback after it.','Points and stops.','A route a person can read.','Seeing the route makes a late delivery explainable at a glance.','Reads Supabase; hosted on Vercel.','Read-only.'],rep:['Report','A per-vehicle daily summary: stops, time to reach and at each, driving and idle hours, distance, over-speed events.','The day\u2019s events.','One record per vehicle per day.','A factual day without a form filled in.','Built from Supabase.','Generated at end of day.']}};
